  "BirdNET V2.4 model: Min. Conf. 0.7, Min. Prob. 0.03, Sigm. Sens. 1.25, Rec. Length 15 s, Overlap 0": "BirdNET V2.4 模型：最低置信度 0.7，位置阈值 0.03，S 形灵敏度 1.25，录音时长 15 s，重叠 0",
  "Default": "默认",
  "Minimums": "最低值",
  "Min. Conf.: the minimum confidence, the lowest score a detection needs to be kept (CONFIDENCE).&#10;Default BirdSuite (V3 model): {def}&#10;Default BirdNET V2.4: 0.70&#10;Range: 0.01 to 0.99&#10;Higher: fewer detections, more reliable; quiet or distant birds are missed.&#10;Lower: more detections, more of them wrong (the manual confidence of the species replaces it for that species).": "最低置信度：保留一条检测所需的最低分数（CONFIDENCE）。&#10;BirdSuite 默认值（V3 模型）：{def}&#10;BirdNET V2.4 默认值：0.70&#10;范围：0.01 到 0.99&#10;调高：检测更少、更可靠；安静或远处的鸟会被漏掉。&#10;调低：检测更多，其中错误也更多（物种阈值会替代该物种的此值）。",
  "Min. Conf.": "最低置信度",
  "Min. Prob.: the minimum probability of occurrence at the location; species below it this week are left out (SF_THRESH).&#10;Default BirdSuite (V3 model): {def}&#10;Default BirdNET V2.4: 0.03&#10;Range: 0.0005 to 0.99&#10;Higher: only the species expected here (the Whitelist bypasses it).&#10;Lower: more species allowed, rare and vagrant ones too, with more errors.": "位置阈值：位置模型预计本周在此出现的概率低于此值的物种将被排除（SF_THRESH）。&#10;BirdSuite 默认值（V3 模型）：{def}&#10;BirdNET V2.4 默认值：0.03&#10;范围：0.0005 到 0.99&#10;调高：只保留预计在此出现的物种（白名单不受此限）。&#10;调低：允许更多物种，包括罕见种和迷鸟，错误也更多。",
  "Min. Prob.": "最低概率",
  "Analysis": "分析",
  "Sigm. Sens.: bends the model&#x27;s scores before the minimum confidence is applied (SENSITIVITY).&#10;Default BirdSuite (V3 model): {def}&#10;Default BirdNET V2.4: 1.25&#10;Range: 0.5 to 1.5&#10;Higher: scores rise, so more detections and more false ones.&#10;Lower: scores fall, so fewer detections.": "S 形灵敏度：在应用最低置信度之前调整模型的分数曲线（SENSITIVITY）。&#10;BirdSuite 默认值（V3 模型）：{def}&#10;BirdNET V2.4 默认值：1.25&#10;范围：0.5 到 1.5&#10;调高：分数上升，检测更多，误检也更多。&#10;调低：分数下降，检测更少。",
  "Sigm. Sens.": "S 形灵敏度",
  "Rec. Length: seconds of each recorded and analysed file (RECORDING_LENGTH); a change restarts the recording service.&#10;Default BirdSuite (V3 model): {def} s&#10;Default BirdNET V2.4: 15 s&#10;Range: 3 to 60 s&#10;Higher: fewer files; a detection shows up later.&#10;Lower: detections appear sooner; more files, a little more work per minute.": "录音时长：每个录制并分析的文件的秒数（RECORDING_LENGTH）；更改后会重启录音服务。&#10;BirdSuite 默认值（V3 模型）：{def} s&#10;BirdNET V2.4 默认值：15 s&#10;范围：3 到 60 s&#10;调高：文件更少；检测出现得更晚。&#10;调低：检测出现得更快；文件更多，每分钟的处理量略增。",
  "Rec. Length": "录音时长",
  "Overlap: seconds the 3 s analysis windows overlap (OVERLAP).&#10;Default BirdSuite (V3 model): {def} s&#10;Default BirdNET V2.4: 0 s&#10;Range: 0 to 2.9 s&#10;Higher: calls on a window edge are caught; more CPU and repeated detections of one call.&#10;Lower: fewer windows; 0 = side by side, the fastest.": "重叠：3 s 分析窗口之间重叠的秒数（OVERLAP）。&#10;BirdSuite 默认值（V3 模型）：{def} s&#10;BirdNET V2.4 默认值：0 s&#10;范围：0 到 2.9 s&#10;调高：能捕捉到窗口边缘的鸣叫；CPU 占用更多，同一鸣叫可能重复检测。&#10;调低：窗口更少；0 = 首尾相接，最快。",
